				<key>why</key>
				<string>as m (its outline, point for point, in the Italic and here): the middle stroke straight, both edges turning one way: its right edge one line from the foot (slope 0.27, the left edge's 0.278) up to 280 below arch 2 and from 640 into arch 1's shoulder, a circle's arc from the shoulder's extreme (1028,710; was 1016,733); arch 2's crotch on it at 590 (was 476); arch 1's top in arch 2's handle proportions; the knee out of the left edge's line one curve into arch 1's inner extreme, moved 19 left to 805 (was an S); variant F of build/glyph-review/bi-four/stem/ef.pdf, chosen 2026-11-10</string>
			</dict>
			<key>org.myiadidot.italicSource</key>
			<string>Old Standard</string>
		</dict>
